cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these skills, please cite them as below. Cite the data sources named in each skill for any value you use."
type: software
title: "Environment data for on-farm trials and breeding. AI-ready skills for weather, soil and elevation at any point"
abstract: >-
  AI agent skills that fetch daily weather (CHIRPS, CHIRTS, AgERA5),
  elevation (Copernicus DEM) and soil properties (SoilGrids 2.0) for sets of
  points such as farms, trial sites and survey households. Each skill comes
  with the Python script behind it, so results can be reproduced without an
  agent. Built for breeders and climate scientists, for use with tricot
  trials or on their own. Part of maniva, the AgrDataSci open commons of
  evidence, protocols, data and analysis for agricultural research.
version: "0.1.0"
